      "description": "Authentication and conventions for the showcase REST API.",
      "sourcePath": "source/api/overview/index.mdx",
      "body": "---\ntitle: API Overview\ndescription: Authentication and conventions for the showcase REST API.\nkeywords: [\"api\", \"authentication\", \"rest\"]\nicon: server\n---\n\nEvery request carries a bearer token in the `Authorization` header.\n\n<Note title=\"Base URL\">\n  The showcase API lives at `https://api.example.com/v1`.\n</Note>\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Timestamps are ISO 8601 strings in UTC.\n- Identifiers are opaque strings.\n- Errors return a JSON body with `code` and `message`.\n",
